---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — The Ritz Menu Guide"
  description="Privacy policy for The Ritz Menu Guide: Google Analytics, cookies and consent, hosting logs, advertising, and how to contact us."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-guide mt-8">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Almost nothing directly. This site does not run accounts, comments, newsletters,
        or contact forms. We do not ask for your name or any personal information, and we
        hold no account data about you. If you email us, we receive only what you choose
        to write in that email, and we use it only to reply.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics (GA4) to understand which guides readers find
        useful. When you accept cookies, Google Analytics records page views plus
        browser/device information and approximate location (city-level, from IP address).
        It does not collect your name, email address, or anything you type on this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics only runs with your consent. On your first visit a cookie banner asks
        you to accept or reject: accepting enables analytics, rejecting keeps analytics
        and advertising storage denied and no analytics cookies are set. You can change
        your choice at any time with the "Cookie Preferences" link in the footer of any
        page.
      </p>
      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site publishes an ads.txt file naming Google as an authorized digital seller
        for this domain, in preparation for advertising. No advertising units are
        displayed today, so no advertising cookies are set. If advertising is added later,
        this policy will be updated to describe exactly what it collects before it runs.
      </p>
      <h2>Server logs</h2>
      <p>
        Like nearly every website, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may log standard
        technical data — such as IP addresses and pages requested — for security and
        operations. We don't use these logs to identify individuals.
      </p>
      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        We link to external sites (for example, theritzlondon.com). Those sites have their
        own privacy policies; we aren't responsible for their practices.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions: email
        <a href="mailto:hello@ritzmenuguide.org">hello@ritzmenuguide.org</a>
        or use the profiles on our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
